Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:11.74,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is Sentaro late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:14.65,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Window shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:19.65,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Might as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:29.66,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.51,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the summer festival is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.44,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What time you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:38.11,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You guys meeting up somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:40.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:41.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:45.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Didn't get in touch with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.87,0:00:47.86,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:49.22,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:00:50.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.59,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's just that I kinda have this feeling \Nthat we're not gonna be dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.02,0:00:59.75,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,S-Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.75,0:01:01.73,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.73,0:01:03.99,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,My bad, my bad. Did I keep ya waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:10.71,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,And... Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:15.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nothing really. I was just telling Kuwa \NI might not go to the festival tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.30,0:01:18.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What?! But you said you were \Ngoin' with the Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.59,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Sentaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.59,0:01:22.47,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:27.52,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I'll treat ya to a caramel frap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:30.46,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:34.28,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Then let's all go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:37.75,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,To the festival!\NI'd be happy to have you, Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:41.73,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,When we're with you, Ichi,\Nlots of girls come talk to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.08,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Right. Forgot that's the \Ntype of guy you are, Sentaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:46.71,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,H-Heh, gonna go buy that frap!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.32,0:01:51.77,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Ichi, you sure you're okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:54.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter if I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.32,0:01:57.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do about it, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If it's a no-go then I just go \Nback to the way things were.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.23,0:02:05.43,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm a frivolous guy, so I bounce back\N from things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.81,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.23,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It was different with \NTakiguchi-san, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.97,0:02:13.21,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You looked like you really \Ncaught feelings there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.17,0:02:19.54,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What's the hold up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:20.53,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:31.46,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\an1\c&H3F4141&\frz11.11\pos(134.667,166.666)}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.75,0:02:36.76,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.29,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The frap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:39.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:25.50,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Nobara-chan, did you do the next problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.66,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, I just did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.24,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:30.02,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Do it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:33.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\blur1.5\an1\b1\bord0\c&H494E4D&\frz14.79\pos(25.333,60.666)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:33.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H494E4D&\pos(36.666,124.333)\frz14.02}What should we do about the summer festival tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:33.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(55.333,191)}For meeting up and such
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(71.333,247.667)}Wh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:29.74,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(71.333,247.667)}What
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(71.333,247.667)}What time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:31.72,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't even know if it's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:30.74,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(71.333,247.667)}What time did
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:33.21,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs18\an1\b1\bord0\c&H3E4140&\frz14.02\pos(72,253)}What time did
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:33.73,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.77,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:37.13,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is this, and that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:38.36,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:40.63,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Did you have a system crash \Nfrom studying too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.41,0:04:43.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.59,0:04:46.25,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,You say that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:50.01,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that the muffin \Nyou made yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:52.44,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I thought you gave it to Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:55.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I couldn't give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.32,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:01.49,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,We have zero experience when \Nit comes to relationships,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.19,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,so we might not be of much help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.13,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But you can still talk to us about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:15.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But this is my problem, so it's\Nup to me to do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Still, if a time comes \Nwhen I do need help,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:22.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,you guys will be the first I go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:25.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So, when the time comes, \Nplease help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.18,0:05:29.47,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Well, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:31.01,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Give us all ya got!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:33.48,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, but I wouldn't give \Naway that muffin now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.61,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,It's summer after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:36.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:45.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The distance between Senpai and \NI is steadily closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:51.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But the closer we get,\Nthe less we seem to click.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:56.68,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I want to do something about it,\Nbut it never works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:01.41,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's irritating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.77,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,Y'know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:23.57,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,I like you, Ichimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.21,0:06:27.07,flashback,NAKABAYASHI,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.13,flashback,NAKABAYASHI,0,0,0,,Ichi, you're going out with Hasegawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:30.24,flashback,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.03,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:33.32,flashback,NAKABAYASHI,0,0,0,,Are you serious?! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.64,flashback,NAKABAYASHI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} was going for Hasegawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.25,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.25,flashback,SHUN,0,0,0,,Too bad, Nakabayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:42.86,flashback,NAKABAYASHI,0,0,0,,Ichi gets all the cute girls, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.14,0:06:48.17,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,I don't think you should \Ngo out with Hasegawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.62,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,Yeah, her face is cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:55.71,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,but she's been bragging about \Nyou to girls from other schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.71,0:06:58.85,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,Saying stuff like, "Don't you wish you \Nhad a rich, handsome boyfriend like me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.71,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What, seriously? That's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:03.94,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,Yeah, unforgivable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.33,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Just kiddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:08.28,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I already know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:09.94,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:15.16,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,He's seriously rich. \NPart of the Ichimura group or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.40,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is her tone normally like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.40,flashbacktop,HASEGAWA'S FRIEND,0,0,0,,Wha? His house seems dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.52,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:19.85,flashback,HASEGAWA'S FRIEND,0,0,0,,That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:22.13,flashback,HASEGAWA'S FRIEND,0,0,0,,Really amazing.\NIs there a pool in the yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.93,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,I haven't gone over to his \Nplace yet, so I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:27.23,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,But the girls are all over him \Nbecause he's so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:30.06,flashback,HASEGAWA,0,0,0,,I feel like I snagged \Nthe big prize, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.06,0:07:31.32,flashback,HASEGAWA'S FRIEND,0,0,0,,Wow, you're horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:35.05,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,They're talking about me like \NI'm some kind of commodity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:37.51,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.10,0:07:39.22,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:40.75,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:45.29,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Those three words define who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:51.53,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,She's been talking about what you might \Nget her for Christmas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:55.41,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? I dunno if we're gonna \Nbe together till Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:56.93,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:08:00.65,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,It really pisses me off that \Nshe's taking advantage of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.58,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,I'll listen to you vent if you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.58,0:08:05.29,flashback,SHIORI,0,0,0,,You can call me any time, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:08.13,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.80,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Jeez, what bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.55,0:08:16.74,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You just want a rich, \Nhandsome boyfriend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:19.47,flashback,GIRLFRIEND A,0,0,0,,Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:21.48,flashback,GIRLFRIEND B,0,0,0,,Ichimura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.03,flashback,GIRLFRIEND C,0,0,0,,Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.74,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,In the end, they're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:30.34,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What they want is the status \Nof dating the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:34.53,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's why I never expected anything \Nand didn't ask for anything in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:38.04,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in \Npeople to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.87,flashback,KOHAKU'S MOM,0,0,0,,It seems Ryu-kun broke \Nup with them, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:45.07,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,He just needs to get \Nhis priorities straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:49.25,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,When it comes to love, just having \Na taste of it should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\fs15\c&H0D0908&\pos(454.667,40)\frz13.15\frx18\fry342}No Smoking
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\b1\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\c&H0D0908&\frx12\fry338\frz6.693\pos(244.001,287.999)}Due to the\Nsummer\Nfestival,\Nvehicles\Nprohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.98,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\fs8\c&H0D0908&\pos(237.334,45.334)\frz11\frx10\fry350}Under\NSurveillance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:09.23,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.37,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Could you take this upstairs for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.37,0:09:12.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:17.79,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's this about you wanting \Nto help out at work all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:21.03,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,You're not going to the festival \Nwith your friends this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:25.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What? No, they're both \Nbusy this year, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:28.71,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I never heard back from Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.56,0:09:32.86,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And without any fanfare,\Nthe day arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:37.80,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I mean, I really should just contact him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.34,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H1A272D&\bord0.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\frx44\fry16\pos(237.333,13.334)\3c&HB3DDE8&\frz12.43}Nature's Blessing Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:38.47,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H1A272D&\bord0.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\frx44\fry16\3c&HB3DDE8&\frz12.43\pos(235.333,15.334)}Nature's Blessing Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.26,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\c&H1A272D&\bord0.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\frx44\fry16\3c&HB3DDE8&\frz12.43\pos(233.333,19.334)}Nature's Blessing Rice
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:39.65,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.82,0:09:45.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What would I do if he \Nsaid, "Let's not go"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:50.10,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop thinking about that,\Nso I just didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:52.60,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Yoi-san, I'll help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.13,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:00.68,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Please place it on the shelf over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.68,0:10:01.46,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:10.00,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,By the way, whatever happened with \Nthat person you were talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:14.84,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,The one who wasn't sure whether to wear \Na yukata to the summer festival or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:18.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:21.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,She decided not to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:22.76,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,What?! Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.57,0:10:28.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,She's a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:32.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,She becomes especially timid \Nwhen it comes to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:38.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, she doesn't really \Nknow anything about falling in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.08,0:10:42.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And while she was trying to work it out,\N it just slipped away from her...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:49.86,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,But she felt that way because \Nshe loves him, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:54.14,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,I mean, when you love someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:57.26,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,you don't want to look uncool \Nor clumsy in front of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.06,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,and you don't want to get hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:05.15,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Besides, you know right \Naway if you love someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:06.57,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.22,0:11:11.01,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,You'll always find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:17.61,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,No matter how crowded a place may be,\N you'll spot them right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:20.61,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Before you realize it,\Nyou can't stop watching them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:25.46,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,And once you see them,\Nyou can't tear your eyes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:34.81,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We often know ourselves the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.43,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:43.09,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:43.77,Default,TAKUTO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.80,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Dad! I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:57.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:02.66,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.03,Default,YOI'S DAD,0,0,0,,Is she in a rebellious phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Hello? Kotobuki? Nobara?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.51,0:12:13.62,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What's up, Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.87,italics,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Are you outside? And running?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:17.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah! Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:21.59,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\bord1.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an1\c&H9C4CC3&\pos(422,306)\frz12.92}Fortune Telling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:20.53,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I know it's awkward \Nto ask this now, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:24.42,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:27.33,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,What? Sorry, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:28.83,italics,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.06,0:12:34.47,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Th-That's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry for suddenly asking \Nsomething weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.73,italics,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh! A rental!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:42.46,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,When I was writing a story about \Ndating in a kimono before,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:45.76,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I interviewed a nearby \Nkimono rental store.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.05,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,I'll send you the link right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:49.66,italics,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Nice, Nobara-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:51.12,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's closer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:54.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nobara! You too, Kotobuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.76,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Festivals are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.99,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You're {\i1}really{\i0} enjoying \Nyourself, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:12.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:15.35,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,There's still lots of places \Nto visit, so let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:16.35,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.59,Default,GIRL'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.34,0:13:20.73,Default,GIRL A,0,0,0,,It's Shun-kun and his crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:23.23,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Seriously, is it just you and\N the guys? Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:24.69,Default,GIRL B,0,0,0,,Funny we ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:25.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:27.98,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What?! You're the girls \Nfrom Class D, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.41,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:31.31,Default,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Totally unlikely!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:34.30,Default,GIRL A,0,0,0,,But I can't believe you came\N after turning down our invite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:37.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What? What's this about an invite?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.21,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What?! No way! You guys invited us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:37.43,top,GIRL A,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:41.39,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Sorry, I figured you wouldn't want to go \Nwith them, so I said we weren't going,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.43,0:13:39.25,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,What? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.39,0:13:43.63,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,but it seems like the info got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:47.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah. It's nothin' you need \Nto apologize for, Kuwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:51.18,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,But still, would it be bad if \NTakiguchi-san found out about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:56.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Ah... Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I invited her, but she didn't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:13:58.99,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,What, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.54,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,How did you invite her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:01.90,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Did you say something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:06.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Not really. I just asked her... \Nif the promise was still...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:06.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(202,76)}I'm sorry. I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:06.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HECF2E0&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(354.667,116.667)}Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:06.24,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(242.666,204)}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:06.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\pos(203.333,70.667)\frz18.19}I'm sorry. I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:06.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HECF2E0&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(357.334,112.667)}Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:06.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(243.999,198.666)}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:06.49,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz18.19\pos(204.666,67.334)}I'm sorry. I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:06.49,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HECF2E0&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(360.667,109.334)}Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:06.49,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz17.98\pos(245.332,195.333)}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.70,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz18.19\pos(204.666,64.001)}I'm sorry. I have work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.70,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HECF2E0&\fs12\frz18.98\pos(361.334,104.667)}Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.49,0:14:07.70,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&H747972&\fs12\frz17.98\pos(245.332,190.667)}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:11.20,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Crap. I didn't send it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.33,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You airhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:14.20,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,And your battery is at two percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:16.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I thought I sent it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.49,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,So just send it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:19.88,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,What are {\i1}you guys{\i0} talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:22.88,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Hey, we should go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.96,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Everyone's about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:26.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry. Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.73,0:14:31.30,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.06,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm so dense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:39.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,And selfish as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.68,0:14:44.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't want him to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.58,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:53.82,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I was focused on my own pride, \Nand on protecting myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.67,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\c&H3F4046&\bord0\frz15.69\pos(262.667,102)\frx14\fry2}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:02.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But Senpai still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:06.11,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,always came to me regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:26.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Damn it, why are they out of chargers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HEEEDE9&\frz354.2\pos(482,58.667)\frx8\fry356}Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord2\c&HEEEDE9&\frz354.2\frx8\fry358\pos(399.333,130.667)\3c&H859034&}Today
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:27.36,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\an1\bord0\c&HEEEDE9&\frz354.2\pos(422.667,208.667)\frx8\fry358}Is our promise still on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:31.86,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure there was a\Nconvenience store across the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:39.04,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:41.29,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.70,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,What are you doing by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:45.26,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Let's walk around and enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:49.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about me.\NGo play with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.54,0:15:52.94,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,What? But that no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:54.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It'll be super fun. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:59.39,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Liar. You look super \Nbored right now, Ichimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:02.41,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm super...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:14.01,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She was a different kind of girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:19.37,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The line of her neck stands out,\N maybe because of her short hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:25.04,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs15\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\c&HD8F8F3&\frz21.92\pos(66.666,204)\frx10\fry0}Manga Encyclopedia
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:25.04,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She reminded me of something. \NThis had to be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:30.81,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,She was a kind of girl \NI've never met before, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:41.22,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,No matter where we were, I was somehow \Nable to notice her right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:50.19,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's\Na way I can have her...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:52.66,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Look this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:54.83,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:16:59.83,italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Only have eyes for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.69,0:17:03.75,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:07.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:08.89,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:11.21,Default,FUNABA,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.21,0:17:18.89,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.35,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:23.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.70,0:17:31.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You've come this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:32.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Don't run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:39.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But, you were with a girl, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.41,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I thought I'd be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:43.69,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.30,0:17:45.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That's seriously ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:46.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Rid—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.44,0:17:48.63,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Could you please spare me that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:50.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's not... ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,To me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:18:03.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm... far less honest than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And I'm a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:12.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,The only time I've ever held hands\Nwith a boy was during a folk dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:15.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Being told I had a sweet tooth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.18,0:18:18.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,being carried like a princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:21.12,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,being called by my first name,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:26.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and being told I'm... cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:30.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'd never had any of that before, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.11,0:18:36.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone who \Nwas interested in me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:38.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So, when someone actually made \Nadvances towards me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:41.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be thought of \Nas someone easily won over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.11,0:18:48.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't want to be seen as someone \Ngullible and easily tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:50.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:54.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I really do want you to \Nbe more into me, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.84,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I want you to say more sweet things to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:59.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,In fact, I want you to be \Ncompletely infatuated with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.59,0:19:11.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for trying to \Nact like a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:16.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:21.39,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Are you saying you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:28.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:34.42,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Take off your mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:38.19,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Take it off and look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.15,0:20:03.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Damn. I could die right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:06.14,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai's heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.85,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's beating so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:13.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:17.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're going to get heatstroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:18.70,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:22.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,W-We have to go to the festival, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:25.46,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Someone might see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:28.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah... But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:35.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.08,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:05.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,My... My heart isn't ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:08.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.50,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We can cross that bridge \Nwhen we come to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.61,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'll wait patiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.45,0:21:22.38,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,For now, let's enjoy the festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.17,0:21:34.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,We gotta be careful that Kuwa \Nand Sentaro don't find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:37.56,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If we run into them now, \Nit'll be a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:40.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Such a big hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:41.95,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:44.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,The yukata...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:46.37,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It looks great on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.71,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It makes me super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:53.87,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Ever since we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Whenever I'm with Senpai,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.81,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I feel like I can just be a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:07.38,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,The boy who's special to me.
